tings Tab -\n- Fog Removal\n- Particles (For the highlight)\n- Audio Removal\n- Distance GUI (Hide/Show Distance GUI)\n- Highlights\n————————————————\nMore features:\n- You can now toggle any settings on/off whatever according to your preferences.\n- Added a state that indicates whether if you’re in danger or safe. (0-200 studs = danger, 300+ studs = safe.)\n- Highlights will now change color depending on how close the killer is to the player. (400-500+ studs = green, 200-399 studs = yellow, 0-200 studs = red).\n\nThis script should be more optimized and easy-to-use for both PC & Mobile.\n\nLet me know if you have any idea or suggestions on what should I add.","tags":["Midnight","horror","fun","highlight","npc"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"66fb3faf30b83d7bd0abd67e","username":"XWelly","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"66fb3faf30b83d7bd0abd67e","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T03:08:30.678Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e7b360710ec3c54e1c","editBy":{"_id":"66fb3faf30b83d7bd0abd67e","username":"XWelly","status":"offline","id":"66fb3faf30b83d7bd0abd67e"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T23:08:06.458Z"}],"comments":[]}